1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,026
Flipkart just changed the game

2
00:00:02,056 --> 00:00:04,061
for its biggest sale of the year.

3
00:00:04,091 --> 00:00:05,599
The Big Billion Days sale

4
00:00:05,629 --> 00:00:08,587
was originally scheduled to start in October…

5
00:00:08,617 --> 00:00:10,523
But Flipkart has now introduced

6
00:00:10,553 --> 00:00:13,677
an early-bird sale from September 24.

7
00:00:13,707 --> 00:00:16,492
And if you’re planning to buy a new smartphone…

8
00:00:16,522 --> 00:00:18,177
you might want to wait.

9
00:00:18,207 --> 00:00:22,167
The iPhone 17 is expected to get a major discount,

10
00:00:22,197 --> 00:00:26,295
potentially dropping below ₹80,000 during the sale.

11
00:00:26,325 --> 00:00:28,297
Samsung is also in the game.

12
00:00:28,327 --> 00:00:32,950
The Galaxy S25 is being teased at under ₹60,000,

13
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:38,067
while the Galaxy S25 FE could drop below ₹50,000.

14
00:00:38,097 --> 00:00:39,226
And there’s more.

15
00:00:39,256 --> 00:00:43,039
Eligible Axis Bank and ICICI Bank card users

16
00:00:43,069 --> 00:00:45,691
can get an additional 10% discount,

17
00:00:45,721 --> 00:00:48,475
while Flipkart Axis Bank Credit Card users

18
00:00:48,505 --> 00:00:51,431
can also get an instant 10% discount.

19
00:00:51,461 --> 00:00:54,507
super.money users can get 10% cashback.

20
00:00:54,537 --> 00:00:55,819
But remember…

21
00:00:55,849 --> 00:00:59,747
these teased prices aren’t necessarily the final prices.

22
00:00:59,777 --> 00:01:01,555
The main Big Billion Days sale

23
00:01:01,585 --> 00:01:05,163
officially starts October 9, according to Flipkart.

24
00:01:05,193 --> 00:01:08,928
So if you’re planning to buy an iPhone or Samsung flagship…

25
00:01:08,959 --> 00:01:10,968
September 24 onwards,

26
00:01:10,998 --> 00:01:13,059
keep your Flipkart app ready.

27
00:01:13,089 --> 00:01:15,658
Because this year’s festive smartphone deals

28
00:01:15,688 --> 00:01:18,200
could get very interesting.

